# Supabase Configuration
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# Note for Google Sign-In & Sign-Up Setup:
# 1. Go to your Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> Google
# 2. Enable Google Provider and paste your Client ID & Client Secret from Google Cloud Console.
# 3. In Google Cloud Console, add the Authorized Redirect URI provided by Supabase:
#    https://<your-project-id>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
# 4. In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> URL Configuration -> Redirect URLs:
#    Add your local dev URL: http://localhost:5173/ (or http://localhost:3000/)
